# Per-machine, never committed. `env` (no dot) is the template and is tracked.
.env

# The replica-set keyfile and the CSFLE master key, both generated by up.sh.
# ⚠️ Losing secrets/csfle-master-key makes every encrypted field on this cluster unreadable
# permanently — there is no escrow. See README.md §CSFLE.
secrets/
